error[T-Bound]: `E` requires `Settle`, and `task.Unstarted[<closure>]` does not implement it
  --> tests/tasks/a_linear_body_does_not_settle_a_failed_prepare.lin:19:35
   |
19 |     let slot = task.prepare(body).settled()?
   |                                   ^^^^^^^ `<closure>` is not `Discardable`; pass a value whose type implements it
